 hrefLang="vi" class="block rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-indigo-50/80 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white" href="/vi">Tiếng Việt</a></div></details><span class="hidden items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-fuchsia-500 to-violet-600 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-fuchsia-950/20 sm:flex">Play <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></span></div></div><nav aria-label="Mobile navigation" class="acf-hide-scrollbar mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] gap-1 overflow-x-auto border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-2 lg:hidden"><a class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-50/80" href="/codes">Codes</a><a class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-50/80" href="/beginner-guide">Beginner</a><a class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-50/80" href="/packs">Packs</a><a class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-50/80" href="/cards">Cards</a><a class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-50/80" href="/mutations">Mutations</a><a class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-50/80" href="/offline-money">Offline Money</a></nav></header><main><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebSite","name":"Anime Card Farm Wiki","url":"https://animecardfarm.com/","description":"A fast, source-checked Anime Card Farm wiki for codes, packs, card upgrades, mutations, offline money, current updates and official Roblox links.","inLanguage":["en","es","pt-BR","id","vi"]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Anime Card Farm Wiki","url":"https://animecardfarm.com/","description":"Independent fan guide. Not affiliated with Roblox or Anime Card Factory."}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the right Anime Card Farm game?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Use Roblox place 125039473548047. The current verified creator is the Anime Card Factory group, ID 973045631."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are there working Anime Card Farm codes in August 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No code has a current official or recorded August in-game confirmation here. Four July codes remain in the recheck list, while timed community and guild batches are expired."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Anime Card Farm earn money offline?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The official Roblox description says packs open and money generates while you are offline."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a reliable Anime Card Farm tier list?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not from current public official data. Use the income shown on your own cards and compare upgrade payback instead of accepting made-up card names or rates."}}]}</script><section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10 py-10 sm:py-14 lg:py-16"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 "><div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.02fr)_minmax(420px,0.98fr)] lg:items-center"><div><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan-300">Roblox player guide · checked August 5, 2026</p><h1 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-black leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.055em] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Anime Card Farm Wiki</h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-[17px] leading-8 text-indigo-100/70 sm:text-lg">Codes without fake status, a three-move first session, pack and card decisions based on the numbers in your game, mutation timing, offline money and the correct official links.</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-fuchsia-500 to-violet-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-fuchsia-950/20" href="/beginner-guide">Start the beginner route<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white backdrop-blur" href="/codes">Check codes</a></div><div class="mt-7 grid max-w-3xl grid-cols-2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.065] sm:grid-cols-4"><div class="border-b border-r border-white/10 p-3.5 last:border-r-0 sm:border-b-0"><p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-indigo-100/50">Players snapshot</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-black text-white">17,327</p></div><div class="border-b border-r border-white/10 p-3.5 last:border-r-0 sm:border-b-0"><p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-indigo-100/50">Visits</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-black text-white">35.7M</p></div><div class="border-b border-r border-white/10 p-3.5 last:border-r-0 sm:border-b-0"><p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-indigo-100/50">Favorites</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-black text-white">1.14M</p></div><div class="border-b border-r border-white/10 p-3.5 last:border-r-0 sm:border-b-0"><p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-indigo-100/50">Approval</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-black text-white">97.7%</p></div></div></div><figure class="relative"><div class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-500/30 via-violet-600/10 to-cyan-400/25 blur-2xl"></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[1.65rem] border border-white/20 bg-[#111538] p-2.5 shadow-[0_32px_100px_rgba(0,0,0,0.38)]"><img src="/media/roblox/anime-card-farm-hero.jpg" alt="Anime Card Farm player opening a rainbow-bordered card" width="768" height="432" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="sync" class="aspect-video w-full rounded-[1.25rem] object-cover"/><figcaption class="px-2 pb-1 pt-3 text-xs leading-5 text-indigo-100/60">Official Anime Card Farm Roblox media, downloaded locally for faster loading.</figcaption></div></figure></div></div></section><section class="border-b border-white/10 py-4"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 "><p class="text-sm leading-6 text-indigo-100/60">Live counts move constantly. These numbers are a dated public API snapshot, not an analytics estimate.<!-- --> <a class="font-black text-cyan-300" href="/updates">Open the dated snapshot →</a></p></div></section><section class="py-8 sm:py-10 "><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 "><div class="mb-5 max-w-4xl"><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-cyan-300">Find the answer</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-0.035em] text-white sm:text-4xl">What are you trying to finish?</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-7 text-indigo-100/70 sm:text-base">The main player jobs are one click away. You should not need to browse a maze of near-duplicate pages.</p></div><div class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/codes"><span class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">I need codes</span><span class="mt-2 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">See the current August answer, four July rechecks and the batches that are already expired.</span><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open answer <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/beginner-guide"><span class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">I just joined</span><span class="mt-2 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Open a pack, replace your weakest earner and leave with a useful next target.</span><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open answer <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/packs"><span class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Pack or upgrade?</span><span class="mt-2 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Enter the four numbers on your screen and compare payback time.</span><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open answer <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/cards"><span class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Which card stays?</span><span class="mt-2 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Compare displayed income instead of trusting a made-up universal tier list.</span><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open answer <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/mutations"><span class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">When should I mutate?</span><span class="mt-2 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Protect Mutation Potions and Trait Gems until the base card is worth keeping.</span><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open answer <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/offline-money"><span class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">How do I earn offline?</span><span class="mt-2 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Use a short logout checklist built around the developer-confirmed offline loop.</span><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open answer <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class="py-8 sm:py-10 bg-white/[0.035]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 "><div class="mb-5 max-w-4xl"><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-cyan-300">Quick start</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-0.035em] text-white sm:text-4xl">The whole early loop in three moves</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-7 text-indigo-100/70 sm:text-base">Do this before you chase a mutation, a leaderboard spot or another shiny pull.</p></div><div class="acf-paper rounded-[1.6rem] p-5 sm:p-7"><div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(320px,0.8fr)] lg:items-center"><div><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-violet-700">Quick answer</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-slate-950 sm:text-3xl">Open, compare, then reinvest — in that order.</h2><div class="mt-3 text-[16px] leading-8 text-slate-700">The developer confirms the important loop: packs reveal cards, upgrades raise earnings, stronger packs replace weaker pulls, rare mutations add boosts, and money continues offline. The exact prices and card values live in the game, so the wiki helps you use those numbers rather than inventing its own.</div></div><ol class="grid gap-2.5"><li class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/[0.045] p-3.5 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-slate-800"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-500 to-violet-600 text-xs font-black text-white">1</span>Open a pack you can afford without emptying your next upgrade budget.</li><li class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/[0.045] p-3.5 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-slate-800"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-500 to-violet-600 text-xs font-black text-white">2</span>Compare the new card&#x27;s income per second with your weakest current earner.</li><li class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/[0.045] p-3.5 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-slate-800"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-500 to-violet-600 text-xs font-black text-white">3</span>Upgrade a card you expect to keep, or save for the next pack if its payback is faster.</li></ol></div></div></div></section><section class="py-8 sm:py-10 "><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 "><div class="mb-5 max-w-4xl"><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-cyan-300">Guidebook</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-0.035em] text-white sm:text-4xl">Pick the chapter that matches your next decision</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-7 text-indigo-100/70 sm:text-base">Each launch page has its own job: status page, guide, calculator, comparison or dated reference.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4"><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(42,18,94,0.24)]" href="/codes"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-sm font-black text-violet-600">01</span><span class="rounded-full bg-violet-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-violet-700">Check before you paste</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Codes</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Current August answer, July reports, expired batches and a four-step redeem route.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open chapter <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(42,18,94,0.24)]" href="/beginner-guide"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-sm font-black text-violet-600">02</span><span class="rounded-full bg-violet-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-violet-700">Three-step start</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-slate-950">First session</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Open, compare, upgrade and leave the farm in a better state without wasting early Cash.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open chapter <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(42,18,94,0.24)]" href="/packs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-sm font-black text-violet-600">03</span><span class="rounded-full bg-violet-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-violet-700">Interactive tool</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Packs &amp; upgrades</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Use the payback calculator to decide whether the next pack or the next upgrade wins.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open chapter <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(42,18,94,0.24)]" href="/cards"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-sm font-black text-violet-600">04</span><span class="rounded-full bg-violet-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-violet-700">Keeper checklist</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Cards</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Judge a pull by the income number on your screen instead of trusting an invented universal tier list.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open chapter <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(42,18,94,0.24)]" href="/mutations"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-sm font-black text-violet-600">05</span><span class="rounded-full bg-violet-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-violet-700">Resource timing</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Mutations &amp; traits</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Protect Trait Gems and Mutation Potions until the underlying card is worth keeping.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open chapter <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(42,18,94,0.24)]" href="/offline-money"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-sm font-black text-violet-600">06</span><span class="rounded-full bg-violet-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-violet-700">Before you leave</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Offline money</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">A logout checklist built around the developer-confirmed offline pack and income loop.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open chapter <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(42,18,94,0.24)]" href="/updates"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-sm font-black text-violet-600">07</span><span class="rounded-full bg-violet-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-violet-700">Checked August 5</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Update tracker</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">The current [CRAFT] title, API update time and public changes without guessed recipes.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open chapter <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="acf-paper group rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(42,18,94,0.24)]" href="/official-links"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-sm font-black text-violet-600">08</span><span class="rounded-full bg-violet-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-violet-700">Avoid wrong games</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Official links</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">The exact place, current verified creator group and a warning about an expired Discord invite.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-black text-violet-700">Open chapter <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class="py-8 sm:py-10 bg-white/[0.035]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 "><div class="mb-5 max-w-4xl"><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-cyan-300">Current public signal</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-0.035em] text-white sm:text-4xl">Crafting is in the title; recipes are not public yet</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-7 text-indigo-100/70 sm:text-base">The official Roblox title currently begins with [CRAFT🔨]. That confirms a crafting update signal, but it does not tell us the station, recipes, costs or success rules.</p></div><div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(420px,0.9fr)] lg:items-center"><div class="acf-paper rounded-[1.5rem] p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-check h-7 w-7 text-violet-700"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">What you can trust today</h3></div><div class="mt-5"><ul class="grid gap-2.5"><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700"><span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>The current experience title is [CRAFT🔨] Anime Card Farm.</li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700"><span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Roblox public metadata shows the experience updated on August 2, 2026.</li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700"><span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>The public description still confirms packs, upgrades, mutations, offline money and the leaderboard.</li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700"><span class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>No official public recipe table or crafting rate was found in the checked source set.</li></ul></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="rounded-full bg-slate-950 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white" href="/updates">Read the update tracker</a><a class="rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-violet-700" href="/crafting">What we know about crafting</a></div></div><figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-[1.45rem] border border-white/10 bg-[#0f1438] p-2.5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.24)]"><img src="/media/roblox/card-collection.jpg" alt="Four glowing Anime Card Farm cards displayed on a table" width="768" height="432" loading="lazy" fetchPriority="auto" decoding="async" class="aspect-video w-full rounded-[1.05rem] object-cover"/><figcaption class="px-2 pb-1 pt-3 text-xs leading-5 text-indigo-100/60">Official Roblox media shows card collecting, but it does not document the new crafting rules.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="py-8 sm:py-10 "><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 "><div class="mb-5 max-w-4xl"><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-cyan-300">Progression model</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-0.035em] text-white sm:text-4xl">Four checks keep the farm moving</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-7 text-indigo-100/70 sm:text-base">This route is deliberately simple. It survives balance changes because it uses what your own screen shows.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="acf-paper rounded-[1.35rem] p-5"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-violet-100 text-sm font-black text-violet-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-400">Step <!-- -->1</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Read the income</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Use the per-second value shown on the card. Rarity art is exciting; income pays for the next choice.</p></article><article class="acf-paper rounded-[1.35rem] p-5"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-violet-100 text-sm font-black text-violet-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-coins h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6"></circle><path d="M18.09 10.37A6 6 0 1 1 10.34 18"></path><path d="M7 6h1v4"></path><path d="m16.71 13.88.7.71-2.82 2.82"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-400">Step <!-- -->2</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Protect your Cash</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Do not spread upgrades across cards you expect to replace in the next pack tier.</p></article><article class="acf-paper rounded-[1.35rem] p-5"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-violet-100 text-sm font-black text-violet-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"></path><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"></path><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-400">Step <!-- -->3</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Raise the floor</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Replace the weakest active earner before paying heavily to improve an already strong slot.</p></article></div><div class="mt-4 acf-dark-card rounded-[1.35rem] p-5 text-white"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check mt-1 h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-cyan-300"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><div><h3 class="text-xl font-black">The wiki will not publish a fake card tier list.</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-7 text-indigo-100/70">There is no current official public card database, drop table or upgrade-cost table. The useful answer is a comparison method and player-entered calculators until stronger evidence exists.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-8 sm:py-10 bg-white/[0.035]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 "><div class="mb-5 max-w-4xl"><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-cyan-300">FAQ</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-0.035em] text-white sm:text-4xl">Quick answers before you return to the game</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-7 text-indigo-100/70 sm:text-base">If the short answer is enough, use it. The linked chapter adds the details only when you need them.</p></div><div class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="acf-paper rounded-[1.3rem] p-5"><h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-950">What is the right Anime Card Farm game?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Use Roblox place 125039473548047. The current verified creator is the Anime Card Factory group, ID 973045631.</p></article><article class="acf-paper rounded-[1.3rem] p-5"><h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-950">Are there working Anime Card Farm codes in August 2026?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">No code has a current official or recorded August in-game confirmation here. Four July codes remain in the recheck list, while timed community and guild batches are expired.</p></article><article class="acf-paper rounded-[1.3rem] p-5"><h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-950">Does Anime Card Farm earn money offline?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Yes. The official Roblox description says packs open and money generates while you are offline.</p></article><article class="acf-paper rounded-[1.3rem] p-5"><h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-950">Is there a reliable Anime Card Farm tier list?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Not from current public official data. Use the income shown on your own cards and compare upgrade payback instead of accepting made-up card names or rates.</p></article></div><aside class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-cyan-300/20 bg-cyan-300/[0.07] px-4 py-3.5 text-sm leading-6 text-cyan-50/75"><strong class="mr-2 text-cyan-200">Wrong-game check<!-- -->:</strong>The correct place ID is <strong>125039473548047</strong> and the current verified creator group is <strong>Anime Card Factory</strong>. Similar Roblox titles have different codes and mechanics.</aside></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="relative border-t border-white/10 bg-[#070923]/88 text-white"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] gap-10 px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_2fr] lg:px-8"><div class="max-w-md"><a class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3" aria-label="Anime Card Farm Wiki home" href="/"><span class="relative flex h-11 w-10 rotate-[-4deg] items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/25 bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-500 via-violet-600 to-cyan-400 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(192,38,211,0.3)]">ACF</span><span class="hidden sm:block"><span class="block text-[15px] font-black leading-4 text-white">Anime Card Farm</span><span class="mt-1 block text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan-100/60">Player Wiki</span></span></a><p class="mt-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-indigo-100/60">A practical Anime Card Farm guide built around the official Roblox experience, dated public data and tools that use the numbers from your own farm.</p><div class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/10 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-100/70"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-clock h-4 w-4 text-cyan-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M3 10h5"></path><path d="M17.5 17.5 16 16.3V14"></path><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="6"></circle></svg> Source set checked <!-- -->August 5, 2026</div></div><div class="grid gap-7 sm:grid-cols-3"><nav aria-label="Start footer links"><h2 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-cyan-200/60">Start</h2><div class="mt-3 grid gap-2.5"><a class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-100/70 hover:text-white" href="/codes">Codes</a><a class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-100/70 hover:text-white" href="/beginner-guide">Beginner guide</a><a class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-100/70 hover:text-white" href="/packs">Packs calculator</a><a class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-100/70 hover:text-white" href="/official-links">Official links</a></div></nav><nav aria-label="Build footer links"><h2 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-cyan-200/60">Build</h2><div class="mt-3 grid gap-2.5"><a class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-100/70 hover:text-white" href="/cards">Cards</a><a class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-100/70 hover:text-white" href="/mutations">Mutations</a><a class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-100/70 hover:text-white" href="/offline-money">Offline money</a><a class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-100/70 hover:text-white" href="